      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 418387,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Four-Way Termination & TIME_WAIT",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": "flow-mu42ze1z-25"
    },
    {
      "id": "sub-mu42ze1z-21-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -605,
      "y": 1518,
      "width": 275,
      "height": 171,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu42ze23_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 766453,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 273595,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "TCP is a connection-oriented,\nfull-duplex protocol providing\nreliable stream transport. Sockets\nsynchronize state using explicit\nhandshakes before exchanging\npayload data, and transition\nthrough established states (LISTEN,\nSYN_SENT, ESTABLISHED, FIN_WAIT,\nTIME_WAIT).",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "edge-sub-mu42ze1z-21-sub-mu42ze1z-21-note",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-mu42ze1z-23-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -447,
      "y": 1730,
      "width": 314,
      "height": 114,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu42ze23_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 259623,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 806467,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Client initiates with SYN (Seq=x).\nServer responds with SYN-ACK (Seq=y,\nAck=x+1). Client completes handshake\nwith ACK (Ack=y+1). Both hosts establish\nsequence baseline and initial receive\nwindows.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "edge-flow-mu42ze1z-23-flow-mu42ze1z-23-note",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "flow-mu42ze1z-25-note",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 57,
      "y": 1610,
      "width": 306,
      "height": 114,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [
        "grp_mu42ze23_2"
      ],
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 166377,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 724412,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "text": "Active closer sends FIN. Passive\nreceiver ACKs. Once application closes,\nreceiver sends FIN. Final ACK from\ninitiator triggers TIME_WAIT state (2 *\nMSL) ensuring late arriving segments\ndrain before port reuse.",
      "fontSize": 14,
      "fontFamily": 1,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "boundElements": [
        {
          "id": "edge-flow-mu42ze1z-25-flow-mu42ze1z-25-note",
          "type": "arrow"
        }
      ]
    },
